00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:30,000
Clue is a comedy, thriller, crime film directed by Jonathan Lynn.

3
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Clue finds six colorful dinner guests gathered at the mansion of their host, Mr.

4
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:54,000
Boddy -- who turns up dead after his secret is
exposed: He was blackmailing all of them.

5
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:36,000
With the killer among them, the guests and Boddy's chatty butler
must suss out the culprit before the body count rises.

6
